    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhangi kūlwa Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mhayo kūlwa Longa lwa Shakoolekejiwa. Alilūūlū, mulīkoyiwa kī ī haha a bing'we, nose pye a bose mushilīle kwigūlya ya numba gīko?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo nakūng'witana ntūmami wane Eliakimu, ng'wintūnja o ng'wa Hilikia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūnzwika wei ī ng'hanjo yako, nū nshipi gwako nakūntunga, nū bū sugi wako nang'winhe we. Akūbiza ise wa bazengi ba mu Yelusalemu na wa numba ya ng'wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūfungūlo lwa numba ya ng'wa Daūdi nakūntūūlīla ha mabega gakwe; ū wei ūlū ūlugūla atīho wa kūlugala, hama ūlū ūlugala atilonga wa kūlugūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūng'handīkīja adame jigi, gītī lūmambo lūkomilwe h'ipandī idiimu. Hūna ū kū numba ya ng'wa ise akūbiza isumbī ly'ikījo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likūjo lya numba ya ng'wawe līkūtūūlwa halī we pyī ī lyose; a banhū ba būbyīle wakwe na baana babo, nī shiseme ī shido do do, gītī mabakuli na shikombe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA wa mabità alīhaya, “Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo ū lūmambo ūlo lwalī lūkomiwe h'ipandī idiimu, lūkwīnga; lūkūbbutwa lūgwe, nū nigo ūyo gwalī gūsungilwe higūlya yalo, gūkūtīnwa gwīnge.” Alīhaya SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
